    0.1,
    "Chapter three, lesson one."
   ],
   [
    2.224,
    "Protein folding, and the bonds that hold it."
   ],
   [
    4.959,
    "Here is a long strand of yarn, straight from the shop."
   ],
   [
    8.123,
    "And here it is, rolled into a ball."
   ],
   [
    10.467,
    "Same strand, very different shape, and the ball is the one that fits in the basket."
   ],
   [
    15.623,
    "A protein chain is a little like that."
   ],
   [
    17.967,
    "In this chapter we follow a protein from a loose chain to a working machine, in four levels: primary, secondary, tertiary and quaternary."
   ],
